  <AltText>
    Satoki's reference sheet. She has light skin, red hair, red and pink eyes, two small horns, purple fox ears, and an orange dress with a pink flower pattern and pockets. To fox's right is a height indicator showing that Satoki is 128.3 cm, or 4 feet 2 and a half inches. To her left are the following: 'Small ears & horns', 'Crescent pupils', 'Small flat chest TwT', 'waist length hair', and then hand references showing the front, showing that fox does indeed have paw pads, and the back. To the leftmost side is some more information. First is her name, written in Japanese as 虹川郷鬼, with it written in English as 'Satoki Nijikawa' below that. Next to her English name are fox's pronouns at the time of the ref sheet being created, which were she/her (Satoki's current pronouns are she/they/fox). Below that informs that Satoki is a trans girl. Below that are the colours used for skin, hair, horns, ears, eyes, and clothes.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Satoki's main reference sheet.
